    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial intelligence solution that can assist agents in agents daily missions, providing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications. an artificial intelligence solution that can assist agents in their daily missions, providing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications should also be able to learn from data and improve over time." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components do we need to design to meet these requirements, and what innovation strategy do we propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client requirements, we can leverage we expertise in Large Language Models (LLMs) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities. we will focus on designing an AI solution that integrates a sovereign LLM with a RAG component to provide relevant information, recall applicable rules, and suggest actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The required AI components include: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A sovereign Large Language Model (LLM): we preferred model is the Mistral 7B Instruct, which is EU-origin, has an Apache 2.0 license, and demonstrates strong French-language performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A sovereign Large Language Model (LLM): can be fine-tuned to adapt to the client's specific domain and tone. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) component: Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) component will enable the solution to search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulations, providing more accurate and up-to-date responses. we RAG capabilities include dense vector semantic retrieval, BM25 sparse retrieval, and hybrid retrieval strategies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve the solution over time, we can implement a combination of online and offline learning methods, such as: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quarterly fine-tuning on anonymized data to adapt to changing procedures and regulations. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Leveraging user feedback to adjust the model's performance and suggest improvements. we innovation strategy will focus on the following key aspects: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Progressive deployment: we propose conducting a pilot phase on a limited scope, followed by progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
