        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What sustainability measures can we implement to meet these requirements, and what is we carbon footprint reduction strategy?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can highlight that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has already taken steps towards sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have conducted a bilan carbone in 2023, which assessed Nexus Engineering S.r.l. total Scope 1 and 2 emissions at 148 tCO2e." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. net zero target year is set for 2040." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet these requirements, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can implement several sustainability measures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can utilize Nexus Engineering S.r.l. existing partnerships with green hosting providers, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which offer 100% renewable energy and have ISO14001 certification. utilize will help reduce the carbon footprint associated with data hosting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy, can contribute to reducing energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These practices have been estimated to reduce energy consumption by around 35% compared to Nexus Engineering S.r.l. baseline." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also have a carbon reporting capability based on the GRI Standards (partial), which will enable Nexus Engineering S.r.l. to monitor and report Nexus Engineering S.r.l. progress towards reducing Nexus Engineering S.r.l. carbon footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further support sustainable development, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can propose solutions that rely on low-carbon impact infrastructures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. e-waste management partner, Ecologic (France), is certified for WEEE recycling, ensuring responsible disposal of electronic waste." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our approach will involve a combination of these measures to reduce the environmental footprint of The City of Belval systems of information and contribute to sustainable development." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging Nexus Engineering S.r.l. existing sustainability capabilities and partnerships, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can help achieve The City of Belval goals while also working towards Nexus Engineering S.r.l. own net zero target." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project will be conducted in a progressive manner, with a pilot phase on a limited scope and a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An accompaniment to change and training actions for agents will be expected." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What project management approach do you propose to ensure successful deployment and adoption of the solution?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, you propose a project management approach that leverages our experience with PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFe methodologies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the progressive nature of The project, our can adopt an iterative approach that allows for flexibility and adaptability. our will start by conducting an inception phase to define the project scope, goals, and deliverables, in line with the client's requirements and constraints. an inception phase will be followed by a pilot phase on a limited scope, where our will test and refine the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure successful deployment and adoption of the solution, our will establish a steering committee that will meet monthly to review progress, provide guidance, and make key decisions. our will also maintain a RAID log to identify and mitigate risks, and a decision log to track key decisions and actions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of change management, our will provide accompaniment to change and training actions for agents, including in-person workshops, e-learning, and quick reference guides. our dedicated change manager will work closely with the client to ensure that the solution is integrated into existing practices and that agents are equipped to use the solution effectively. our will also establish a governance structure that includes regular reporting, with weekly status reports and quarterly executive reviews. a governance structure that includes regular reporting, with weekly status reports and quarterly executive reviews will enable our to track progress, identify areas for improvement, and make adjustments as needed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Throughout The project, our will prioritize collaboration and communication with the client, ensuring that the client needs and expectations are met at every stage." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By adopting this structured and flexible approach, our can ensure successful deployment and adoption of the solution, while also minimizing risks and maximizing benefits for the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "### Executive Summary Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. specialized partners, proposes a comprehensive solution for the City of Belval's artificial intelligence (AI) project to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily administrative activities. proposes integrates AI components, ensures regulatory compliance, security, and sustainability while focusing on innovation and reducing environmental footprint. ### Understanding of Requirements the City of Belval's seeks an AI solution that provides intelligent assistance tools for the City of Belval's agents, enhancing access to information, improving the quality of answers, and reducing processing times. a comprehensive solution for the City of Belval's artificial intelligence (AI) project to assist municipal agents in their daily administrative activities must comply with GDPR, ensure data protection, explicability, transparency, and integrate with existing systems without disrupting current workflows. ### Proposed Solution Our consortium will design and deploy a microservices-based AI solution utilizing Docker, Kubernetes, and Helm for containerization and orchestration. a microservices-based AI solution utilizing Docker, Kubernetes, and Helm for containerization and orchestration integrates with the City of Belval's existing system of information, including business software (civil status, town planning), electronic document management (EDM), and user directories through API gateways like Kong or Apigee." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For AI components, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. propose a sovereign Large Language Model (LLM) and Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) component. a sovereign Large Language Model (LLM) will be based on Mistral 7B Instruct, which has strong language performance in French, is licensed under Apache 2.0, and originates from the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) component will utilize dense vector semantic retrieval, BM25 sparse retrieval, and hybrid retrieval strategies for efficient information access." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure regulatory compliance, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. adhere to GDPR requirements, with data hosting exclusively within the EU, no data transfer outside the EU, and sensitive data protected through encryption or anonymization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. solution is designed with explicability and transparency in mind, allowing for clear explanations of recommendations and human oversight over automated decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Security-wise, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. holds ISO 27001 certification valid until November 30, 2026, ensuring a robust security posture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. implement AI security controls such as output PII redaction and confidence threshold escalation to safeguard sensitive information. a comprehensive solution for the City of Belval's artificial intelligence (AI) project to assist municipal agents in their daily administrative activities will be deployed on Outscale's SecNumCloud infrastructure, which meets the sovereignty requirements and provides a low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. approach focuses on digital sobriety practices like int8/int4 model quantization, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, and query result caching to reduce energetic consumption by 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The total contract value is €3,000,000 over 4 years, with an annual average value of €750,000." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. target a gross margin of 28% while ensuring the annual cost of exploitation remains compatible with the local authority's budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For accompaniment to change and training actions, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. offer in-person workshops, e-learning, and quick reference guides." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A dedicated change manager will be assigned, and regular reporting will include weekly status reports and quarterly executive reviews to ensure collaboration and communication are prioritized throughout the project lifecycle. ### Unaddressed Requirements None of the requirements from the tender were left unaddressed by Our consortium proposal. ### Conclusion Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in partnership with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. specialized agents, is confident that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposed AI solution meets the City of Belval's needs for an intelligent assistance tool that integrates with existing systems, ensures regulatory compliance, security, and sustainability while focusing on innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. structured and flexible deployment approach minimizes risks and maximizes benefits, ensuring a successful project outcome." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk19> a prov:Entity ;
